Lab Scenario
Given:

Store credit: $50.00
Product price: $1337.00 (Lightweight "l33t" Leather Jacket)
Discount code: PROMO20 (20% off, single use only)

Goal:
Apply the discount code multiple times to reduce the price low enough to complete the purchase.

Vulnerability
The application checks if a coupon has been used before applying it. However, there is a race condition between:

Checking if the code is already used
Applying the discount
Marking the code as used

If multiple requests arrive simultaneously, they can all pass the "already used" check before any of them marks the code as used.

